(7253349, 1127690, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve gone too far with your hue change. Perhaps a more selective change would have worked better? By that I mean, not so much on the water. I find it interesting that I''m more forgiving of the sky being unnaturally purple than I am of the water... I should think more on this perhaps.</td>', 'I think you''ve gone too far with your hue change. Perhaps a more selective change would have worked better? By that I mean, not so much on the water. I find it interesting that I''m more forgiving of the sky being unnaturally purple than I am of the water... I should think more on this perhaps.', '2014-08-20 23:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7253350, 1127641, 60173, '<td valign="top">What a neat effect that water is giving. It is very much some sort of performance.</td>', 'What a neat effect that water is giving. It is very much some sort of performance.', '2014-08-20 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7253351, 1127683, 60173, '<td valign="top">I buy the purple hair, but the eyes look like they were done in post. Also, for some reason it bothers me a little that I''m seeing the bra straps. <br/> <br/>With all that said, the lighting is pretty good.</td>', 'I buy the purple hair, but the eyes look like they were done in post. Also, for some reason it bothers me a little that I''m seeing the bra straps.  With all that said, the lighting is pretty good.', '2014-08-20 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
