(7255724, 1127687, 141319, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments - agree, I think it was a bit too dark. I had such great plans with a purple glass ball ... didn''t work at all :-), so I used the Orchids alone as a last minute entry. Quite like the somewhat modern design feel using the roots as well.<br/></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments - agree, I think it was a bit too dark. I had such great plans with a purple glass ball ... didn''t work at all :-), so I used the Orchids alone as a last minute entry. Quite like the somewhat modern design feel using the roots as well.', '2014-08-27 03:07:25.000000', NULL, 0),
