(7255926, 1127684, 137576, '<td valign="top">Ooh that''ll do second place, I''ve not been entering much as my business as sky rocketed and I''m super busy.<br/> <br/>Saw the purple challenge and knew the heather on the moors was purple as I drive through it everyday so on Sunday night grabbed the dog and heeded up to stanage edge just outside Sheffield <br/> <br/>Shot a few then the rain storm you can see in the fr distnce hit and me and the dog legged it <br/> <br/>7 shot HDR <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments and votes</td>', 'Ooh that''ll do second place, I''ve not been entering much as my business as sky rocketed and I''m super busy. Saw the purple challenge and knew the heather on the moors was purple as I drive through it everyday so on Sunday night grabbed the dog and heeded up to stanage edge just outside Sheffield  Shot a few then the rain storm you can see in the fr distnce hit and me and the dog legged it  7 shot HDR  Thanks for all the comments and votes', '2014-08-27 16:26:41.000000', NULL, 0),
