(7255967, 1127520, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club.<br/> <br/>Let me start with what I like about your image.1st of all subject matter. You lucked out and got an excellent subject. Subject can make or break an image. Next I love the vivid colors. That is both good and bad for this image.<br/> <br/>Now for the other stuff. I mentioned the vivid colors. The bad aspect of that in this challenge was the lack of purple. I do have to agree with the commenters below that the primary color here is red. I am sure that hurt your score pretty badly. I also think the pollen on the petals is a little distracting.<br/> <br/>I do like the picture overall, but maybe not for this challenge. Keep it up. Good job</td>', 'Hello from the critique club. Let me start with what I like about your image.1st of all subject matter. You lucked out and got an excellent subject. Subject can make or break an image. Next I love the vivid colors. That is both good and bad for this image. Now for the other stuff. I mentioned the vivid colors. The bad aspect of that in this challenge was the lack of purple. I do have to agree with the commenters below that the primary color here is red. I am sure that hurt your score pretty badly. I also think the pollen on the petals is a little distracting. I do like the picture overall, but maybe not for this challenge. Keep it up. Good job', '2014-08-27 18:36:56.000000', NULL, 0),
